14
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.100
Our course example makes three

15
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.340
recursive calls on quarter-size inputs

16
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.260
and performs n units of

17
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.220
