69
00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.660
The leaf exponent is less

70
00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:16.140
than one, so the leaves

71
00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:17.440
do not raise the order

72
00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:18.220
