77
00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.400
Theta of n, not merely

78
00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.740
big O of n.

79
00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:34.260
Compare this with merge sort,

80
00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:36.660
where two half-size calls make

81
00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:38.380
